aboratory", "Fourplus", "CellTherapy", "Bioscience"], "long_description": "Accelerate is a virtual reality training program for GMP operators, designed around Cell & Gene Therapy Catapult\u2019s manufacturing centre in Stevenage, UK. Accelerate navigates trainees through an immersive GMP compliant manufacturing facility, with standardized, modular content spanning: Cleaning, Gowning, Compliance and Health & Safety. The interactive laboratory walkthroughs and simulations provides exposure to a real-life facility, without the risks associated with in-person training.  \n\nAccelerate gives learners the opportunity to experience industry-relevant settings, bioproduction laboratories and clean rooms. In addition, the spillage training applies context to cell and gene transplants within a healthcare facility.  \n\nRemove barriers to high-stakes training and increase workforce competency with Accelerate.  ", "short_description": "Accelerate is a virtual reality training program for GMP operators, designed around Cell & Gene Therapy Catapult\u2019s manufacturing centre in Stevenage, UK. Accelerate navigates trainees through an immersive GMP compliant manufacturing facility, with standardized, modular content spanning: Cleaning, Gowning, Compliance and Health & Safety. The interactive laboratory walkthroughs and simulations provides exposure to a real-life facility, without the risks associated with in-person training.  "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://fourplus.co.uk/accelerate-privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "FourPlus Immersive", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://fourplus.co.uk/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_co